WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Three pupils, three mentors.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:08.400
With no shared framework or courses, there's no way
to guarantee they get the same support.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.000
Phil gives every mentor the same structured course.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.400
Pick from twenty ready-made, five-week courses.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:22.300
Every session comes with a plan, resources
and guidance for the mentor.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.700
Record it as you go, with a safeguarding step every time.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.100
When they finish, every pupil gets a certificate.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.000
And your reports are ready for governors and Ofsted.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:38.000
Phil was built by a behaviour lead in a London school,

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.500
and it's mapped to DfE, Ofsted and EEF guidance.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:47.600
Start your free three-week pilot at phileducation.co.uk.
